OL,3,AFires lit on streets across France
OL,4,Aafter student protests force hundreds
OL,5,Aof schools to close
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe demonstrations - over a lack of
OL,8,Fteachers, overcrowded classrooms and
OL,9,Frun-down buildings - started earlier
OL,10,Fthis week in Paris then spread across
OL,11,Fthe country
OL,13,F"We are angry," one 16-year-old in
OL,14,FParis tells the BBC, adding "a lot of
OL,15,Fnoise" is needed to bring about change
OL,16,Fin French schools
OL,18,FFrance's justice minister, Gerald
OL,19,FDarmanin, says: "We have gone from
OL,20,Fhigh-school student demonstrations to a
OL,21,Fpublic order disturbance"
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
